    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon</em></p><p><em>It belonged to an eladrin knight-errant who never left the temple. The lantern was forged in the Feywild and knows its kin: hooded, its glow strips the invisible bare within thirty feet. She hangs in the webs unnaturally shriveled, a husk with the life drunk out of it, the lantern still shuttered at her belt — whatever the wisps showed her, she never thought to look at it honestly.</em></p><p>While lit, this hooded lantern burns for 6 hours on 1 pint of oil, shedding Bright Light in a 30-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 30 feet. &amp;Reference[Invisible apply=false] creatures and objects are visible as long as they are in the lantern’s Bright Light. You can take a Utilize action to lower the hood, reducing the lantern’s light to Dim Light in a 5-foot radius.</p>",
